                        "sense_id": "f2994359-5ec0-3aca-9c75-f5f708686faa",
                        "entry_id": "f046df08-a789-30a9-91dd-380e9efbef6e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A diminutive of the female given name Catherine or any of its variant spellings."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86a4f2bc-8dac-463b-9687-1fcf36fee345",
                                "sense_id": "f2994359-5ec0-3aca-9c75-f5f708686faa",
                                "text": "There is one Emily, one Charlotte, no Catherine, but two Kates, and innumerable Katies, which seems to be the latest form that Catherine has taken—Catherine, Kate, Katie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6121924-ebf8-4df3-9ae1-02558342adc0",
                                "sense_id": "f2994359-5ec0-3aca-9c75-f5f708686faa",
                                "text": "And \"Mable\"'s a name that ever sounds sweetly / And charms and enchants a mortal completely / While \"Katie\" suggests brown eyes and brown tresses / Created for love and lover's caresses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f6ad565-192f-4922-998a-7c91d66bb376",
                                "sense_id": "f2994359-5ec0-3aca-9c75-f5f708686faa",
                                "text": "The pixels’ use in a taxpayer context resulted in the “reckless” sharing of legally protected data that could put taxpayers at risk, according to the report by Warren and her Democratic colleagues Sens. Ron Wyden; Richard Blumenthal; Tammy Duckworth; and Sheldon Whitehouse; Sen. Bernie Sanders, an independent who caucuses with Democrats; and Democratic Rep. Katie Porter."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
